cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "Understanding Deep Learning — Julia"
abstract: >-
  Interactive Julia (Pluto) notebooks that work through the exercises
  accompanying *Understanding Deep Learning* by Simon J. D. Prince. Following the
  book's arc, they build modern deep learning from first principles — from
  supervised learning and shallow and deep networks, through loss functions,
  gradients, and training, on toward convolutional networks, transformers, and
  generative models — implementing each idea from scratch as a hands-on Julia
  companion to the text.
type: software
